  hawse client  |  tunnel.example.com:4433  |  QUIC

  + ssh        tunnel.example.com:2222       <-  127.0.0.1:22
  + dev        tunnel.example.com:40017      <-  127.0.0.1:3000
  x wireguard  port is not granted to this client
  ~ server stopped answering | retrying in 4.0 s
  x not authorized. on the server, add to server.toml:

      [clients.NAME]
      key = "ed25519:AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"

    then wait for the next retry
  x server `` must be host or host:port; the config cannot be retried
  ~ config reloaded
